ogger: state [eventTime=22.83, mediaPos=21.94, window=0, period=0, ENDED]\r\nD/EventLogger: isPlaying [eventTime=22.83, mediaPos=21.94, window=0, period=0, false]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere is something weird at the beginning though, the length of the window is negative:\r\n```\r\nD/EventLogger: timeline [eventTime=0.66, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0, periodCount=1, windowCount=1, reason=SOURCE_UPDATE\r\n      period [-6020.72]\r\n      window [durationMs=-6020.72, seekable=true, dynamic=false, live=false]\r\n```\r\n\r\n@AquilesCanta, could you take a look at this MPEG-TS media. Even if we do not want to be support it, we might want to throw an exception or at least log when the length do not match.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/745368532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"krocard","id":6862950,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NjI5NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6862950?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard","html_url":"https://github.com/krocard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krocard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4115199054,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NDExNTE5OTA1NA==","url":"ht